<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Rheinbraun Brennstoff/Carboni deAL.</title>
<headline>EU clears Rheinbraun Brennstoff/Carboni deAL.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday it had cleared a move by German company Rheinbraun Brennstoff GmbH, a unit of electricity group RWE, to acquire full control of Italian company Agenzia Carbonia Srl.</p>
</text>
